80167234", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619805_796768083500567_2437208910508634136_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4A4o1FcJHasQ7kNvwGli--H&_nc_oc=AdoYz8rT6L1cGe7WqSU0Yte3ihateqvG6I1yZ_Io9-AYbAlc2FF8XbnvgWvlq3Buh90&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRgpk1gQOmVtEBxFFSW42qjVcsGV0PZaVBYPLhlIBnMqQ&oe=6B05B7FC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageLandscape1.png", "id": "2437183346774056", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622276_2437183350107389_575708754879884824_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jMNCgd0vUjEQ7kNvwGP0ZRK&_nc_oc=AdrbGMnR_ypT0KTewsg3fDV5v7H8Dh2a4OkY1x2qGkXd1DZevHodrsrZvnWW6xf2VIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQn9o4uyYsSozA4XS9MAJweqGb7sq-EJxwrITToRtbHIw&oe=6B05BA3B"}, "display_name": "Raider Legends", "keywords": ["cooperative", "fantasy", "multiplayer", "gorilla", "loot"], "long_description": "**Welcome to Camp**\n\nYou've arrived just in time.\n\nAround here, there's always another Rift on the horizon.\n\nStep inside, conquer the challenge, bring home better loot, become stronger... then do it all again.\n\n{2505685783194274}\n\nRest while you can.\n\nIt won't be long before you're heading back out.\n\n{2931613547335456}\n\nOne last thing...\n\nEvery week brings something new.\n\nNew places.\n\nNew gear.\n\nNew trouble.\n\n{2726092177792254}\n\nIf you've got ideas, or just want to swap stories, come find us in the Raider Legends Discord:\n\n**https://discord.gg/AbjjjcSgyG**\n\nSee you around, kid.\n\n\u2014 Gawk", "short_description": "Team up with friends, conquer ever-changing adventures, discover powerful loot, and become stronger with every run. There's always another Rift waiting."}]}, "developer_name": "Gun Raiders Entertainment Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gunraiders.com/priva